(# Code of Conduct & Workplace Ethics) Tj
T* (## Section 1: Anti-Harassment & Inquiry Committee) Tj
T* (1.1 Acme Tech Solutions maintains zero tolerance for workplace harassment, bullying, or discrimination in accordance with Pakistan Protection Against Harassment Act.) Tj
T* (1.2 Complaints are reviewed by a 3-member Inquiry Committee within 14 working days.) Tj
T* (## Section 2: Conflict of Interest & Gifts) Tj
T* (2.1 Employees must disclose outside engagements and may not accept vendor gifts exceeding PKR 10,000 in value.) Tj
